    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d682">

                <pb facs="0956" n="854" sameAs="frus:frus1933v01/pg854"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.51W89 Czechoslovakia/204.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Czechoslovak Minister</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Veverka</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <p>I have been instructed by the Czechoslovak Government to express its
                    gratification for the invitation to discuss the problem of the Czechoslovak debt
                    as suggested in your <hi rendition="#italic">aide-mémoire.</hi><anchor n="53"
                        xml:id="d682-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>The Czechoslovak representative to the United States will be at the disposal of
                    the United States Government whenever the beginning of such negotiations will be
                    deemed advisable.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1933-01-30">January 30,
                            1933</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d682-f1" n="53" xml:id="d682-f1-content">
